    {
      "id": "cq-details",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "1. DUPLICATED CODE: API routes mirror Server Actions\n   — api/tasks/route.ts duplicates actions/task.ts\n   — Both implement identical CRUD + business rules\n\n2. verifyWorkspaceAccess() copy-pasted 4 times\n   → Extract to shared lib/workspace-access.ts\n\n3. Excessive 'any' types (auth.ts, page.tsx, hooks)\n   → Define JWTPayload interface, type all payloads\n\n4. BROKEN seed.js — references removed UserConfig model\n   → Will crash if run\n\n5. Homepage is 433 lines (mixing concerns)\n   → Extract ModelCard, PasswordModal, Footer, NavBar",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 52,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "groupIds": [
        "cq-group"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 54410827,
      "index": "aY",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779540332342,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. DUPLICATED CODE: API routes mirror Server Actions\n   — api/tasks/route.ts duplicates actions/task.ts\n   — Both implement identical CRUD + business rules\n\n2. verifyWorkspaceAccess() copy-pasted 4 times\n   → Extract to shared lib/workspace-access.ts\n\n3. Excessive 'any' types (auth.ts, page.tsx, hooks)\n   → Define JWTPayload interface, type all payloads\n\n4. BROKEN seed.js — references removed UserConfig model\n   → Will crash if run\n\n5. Homepage is 433 lines (mixing concerns)\n   → Extract ModelCard, PasswordModal, Footer, NavBar",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.0256410256410258
    },
