    {
      "id": "perf-details",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "1. N+1 query in auto-promote\n   → Each promoted task fires a separate updateTask()\n   → Needs a bulk-update server action\n\n2. getSession() called 3× per page (workspaces + tasks + delegates)\n   → Cache with React cache() function\n\n3. Middleware matcher includes routes that do nothing\n   → \"/\" and \"/eisenhower-matrix\" just call next()",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 62,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "groupIds": [
        "perf-group"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1143511877,
      "index": "ab",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779540332342,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. N+1 query in auto-promote\n   → Each promoted task fires a separate updateTask()\n   → Needs a bulk-update server action\n\n2. getSession() called 3× per page (workspaces + tasks + delegates)\n   → Cache with React cache() function\n\n3. Middleware matcher includes routes that do nothing\n   → \"/\" and \"/eisenhower-matrix\" just call next()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.1111111111111112
    },
