      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "✔ Clean Server Action architecture (modern Next.js)\n✔ Optimistic UI updates in useTaskOperations\n✔ Smart auto-scheduling (due today → DO quadrant)\n✔ Security headers (HSTS, CSP, X-Frame-Options)\n✔ Multi-tenant workspace isolation (ownership checks)\n✔ Comprehensive deployment (Docker, K8s, Helm)\n✔ Soft-delete pattern for tasks",
